{title: Tera Milna Pal Do Pal Ka}
{artist: Sonu Nigam}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm] [Bb],        Tera milna pal do pal ka
[Bb] [A],        meri dhadkane churaye
[Dm] [Bb],        Darr hai mujhe pyaar tera
[Bb] [A],        meri jaan le na jaaye
[Dm] [A] [Bb],        Tu bataa kis tarah jiya jaaye haay haay
[Dm] [A],        Ho ho. .ho. .ho.
[Bb] [Gm] [Dm],        Ho.. ..ho. ..ho. ..ho..
[Dm],        Poochho na kya hota mujhe
[A],        Paas jo tu na ho to
[Dm] [A],        Ruke meri saanson ki laher
[Dm],        Soch zara yeh tu bhi
[A],        Pyaar mein tere mujhe
[Dm] [A],        Diya hai jo waadon ka zaher
[Dm] [A] [Bb],        Kis tarah zaher yeh piya jaaye haay haay
